# Cloudflare Pages response headers (ignored as a plain file everywhere else).
#
# COOP/COEP make the site cross-origin isolated, which enables
# SharedArrayBuffer — required by the pthreads-built vampire.wasm. These are
# the same two headers serve.sh sends locally; GitHub Pages cannot send them,
# which is why the Vampire backend only works on the Cloudflare deployment.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
